[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the steering column lower trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045101.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Move the CODE aerial (1a) by releasing both tabs (1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Aerial for CODE</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428779\">P91</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Recover the CODE aerial.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045102.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the aerial is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection and place\nthe aerial in position engaging the tabs.</p><p>Fit the lower steering column cover and\nsecure it using the bolts.</p>"]]